&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;592&quot; data-end=&quot;1027&quot;&gt;The People Experience (PX) Consultant is a trusted advisor and operational excellence partner to HR Business Partners (HRBPs), senior leaders and employees across EMEA, currently spanning at least eight jurisdictions. Working across SIE’s Corporate and Studios organisations, the role combines day-to-day HR delivery with complex project and change management, helping to drive engagement, performance and organisational effectiveness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1029&quot; data-end=&quot;1484&quot;&gt;Operating within a global matrix, the PX Consultant provides expert guidance on HR policy, employment matters and best practice, while partnering with HRBPs, in-country HR teams, Legal and Employee Relations (ER). The role will lead and contribute to complex HR projects, organisational design and regional/global initiatives, using strong analytical capability and sound judgement to solve problems, improve processes and ensure high-quality HR delivery.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1486&quot; data-end=&quot;1978&quot;&gt;As SIE continues to centralise and globalise its People model across EMEA, the PX Consultant will play an important role in helping business leaders and the wider People team navigate this transition. Working closely with two Senior HRBP Leads across Corporate and Studios, the successful candidate will need to flex across different business models, jurisdictions and stakeholder groups while helping establish effective relationships between local teams and the central People organisation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;color: !important;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Collaborate with the Senior HRM (EMEA), HRBP’s, in-country HR Managers and Legal to review, refine, and support the successful delivery of global change management initiatives&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Demonstrate the ability to independently manage and deliver complex HR projects across multiple regions in collaboration with global stakeholders within a highly matrixed organisation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work closely with our Legal and ER teams to deliver subject matter expertise on HR policies, practices, and legal requirements across EMEA&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with global PX teams to execute initiatives that promote engagement, belonging, compensation, benefits, and career growth&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide operational support in all stages of the performance management process including data calibration, data insights and advice/guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Provide system and logistical support for talent mapping, succession planning, and leadership development programs.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Partner with Total Rewards and HRBPs on job architecture, compensation benchmarking, and the internal mobility&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Manage and escalate complex employee and manager issues to our Centers of Excellence (COE) once all possible routes have been exhausted, offering clear recommendations and options.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Own and maintain a high level of data accuracy and input within Workday and Nexus (Service Now), using this data as a source of insights into continuous improvement strategies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Champion best practice in the People Experience (PXC) function&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Champion a strong continuous improvement culture to ensure the deployment of scalable, simplified and standardized processes within&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #000000;&quot;&gt;Work collaboratively across PX functions including our PX Advisors, Legal, COE’s, HRBP’s, in-country HR Managers in various time zones etc. and with our Global partners to ensure consistency and innovation in our people processes.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1530&quot; data-end=&quot;1557&quot;&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1559&quot; data-end=&quot;2971&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bidto6&quot; data-start=&quot;1631&quot; data-end=&quot;1720&quot;&gt;Minimum of 10 years’ (or equivalent) experience working as an HR Generalist and/or HR Business Partner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1a1nhg2&quot; data-start=&quot;1721&quot; data-end=&quot;1854&quot;&gt;Significant experience operating within a global, highly matrixed organisation, ideally within technology, media, retail or gaming.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;tfez8g&quot; data-start=&quot;1855&quot; data-end=&quot;1991&quot;&gt;Demonstrable international HR generalist experience supporting employees and leaders across multiple European countries/jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1gj56n&quot; data-start=&quot;1992&quot; data-end=&quot;2115&quot;&gt;Strong working knowledge of employment legislation, HR practices and cultural nuances across multiple EMEA jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19hafvv&quot; data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2241&quot;&gt;Proven experience managing complex employee lifecycle matters and employee relations issues, alongside broader HR projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;3ttqfg&quot; data-start=&quot;2242&quot; data-end=&quot;2371&quot;&gt;Proven ability to independently manage and deliver complex change initiatives across multiple countries and stakeholder groups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;59m9i3&quot; data-start=&quot;2372&quot; data-end=&quot;2502&quot;&gt;Experience using Workday and HR analytics/data to support decision-making and identify opportunities for continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16v86nc&quot; data-start=&quot;2503&quot; data-end=&quot;2637&quot;&gt;Strong communication and stakeholder management skills, with the ability to collaborate effectively and influence without authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;150jlcl&quot; data-start=&quot;2638&quot; data-end=&quot;2720&quot;&gt;Comfortable operating in ambiguity and within fast-paced, evolving environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bjx42m&quot; data-start=&quot;2721&quot; data-end=&quot;2852&quot;&gt;Confident managing complex and sensitive situations, demonstrating discretion, sound judgement and well-reasoned decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;sr9uh9&quot; data-start=&quot;2853&quot; data-end=&quot;2971&quot;&gt;A collaborative, solutions-focused mindset with a strong focus on operational excellence and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2973&quot; data-end=&quot;2987&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2973&quot; data-end=&quot;2987&quot;&gt;Desirable:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2989&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nr96n2&quot; data-start=&quot;3061&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;Fluency in an additional European language is highly desirable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;nr96n2&quot; data-start=&quot;3061&quot; data-end=&quot;3126&quot;&gt;CIPD qualified (Level 5–7) or equivalent HR qualification/experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;:&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid working&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discretionary bonus opportunity&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dental Scheme&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On Site Gym&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Subsidised Café&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free soft drinks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;On site bar&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to cycle garage and showers&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
